'''Fire Cat''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] pet that can be obtained by hatching it from the [[Common Egg|common egg]] or by trading.

== Appearance ==
Fire Cat has the same design as the [[Cat]], but its whole body is bright red with a fire trail leading behind it.

== Trivia ==
*This item is the non-chroma version of [[Chroma Fire Cat]] and the fire version of [[Cat]].

